---
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    fontSize: 14px
    actorBkg: "#EDF2F7"
    actorBorder: "#879AB0"
    actorTextColor: "#25364A"
    signalColor: "#8B949E"
    signalTextColor: "#344054"
    noteBkgColor: "#F7F1E5"
    noteBorderColor: "#B3A078"
    noteTextColor: "#514532"
  sequence:
    mirrorActors: true
    actorMargin: 24
    messageMargin: 6
    diagramMarginX: 8
    diagramMarginY: 4
    width: 140
    height: 32
    actorFontSize: 14
    messageFontSize: 14
    noteFontSize: 14
    wrap: false
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant C as OCE control plane<br/>/ worker
  participant O as OpenShell / Codex
  participant T as Git / model owners
  C->>O: Admit, prepare workspace
  O-->>C: Bind, verify readiness
  Note over C,O: Uncertain/unready: refuse, no replay
  O->>T: Git/gh + model requests
  T-->>O: Local expiry: deny + close
  C->>O: Retire before replacement
  O-->>C: Report disposal separately
